        <object id="decoder-19" label="&lt;b&gt;Attention dimensions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;8 heads × 32 features/head&lt;br&gt;Self: 16 queries ↔ 16 queries&lt;br&gt;Cross: 16 queries → L context&lt;br&gt;No history-to-history attention" tooltip="Attention dimensions&#10;8 heads × 32 features/head&#10;Self: 16 queries ↔ 16 queries&#10;Cross: 16 queries → L context&#10;No history-to-history attention">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="notes">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1410" y="565" width="342" height="190" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <mxCell id="decoder-20" value="INSIDE EACH DECODER BLOCK  /  Pre-normalized residual sublayers" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#475569;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="820" width="1650" height="35" />
        </mxCell>
        <object id="decoder-21" label="&lt;b&gt;1  Query self-attention&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;y = LayerNorm(x)&lt;br&gt;Q, K, V from the 16 query tokens&lt;br&gt;8 heads → output projection&lt;br&gt;x ← x + SelfAttention(y, y)" tooltip="1  Query self-attention&#10;y = LayerNorm(x)&#10;Q, K, V from the 16 query tokens&#10;8 heads → output projection&#10;x ← x + SelfAttention(y, y)">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="890" width="490" height="195" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="decoder-22" label="&lt;b&gt;2  Context cross-attention&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Q = projected LayerNorm(x)&lt;br&gt;K, V = projected observation context&lt;br&gt;Invalid context slots have −∞ bias&lt;br&gt;x ← x + CrossAttention(Q, context)" tooltip="2  Context cross-attention&#10;Q = projected LayerNorm(x)&#10;K, V = projected observation context&#10;Invalid context slots have −∞ bias&#10;x ← x + CrossAttention(Q, context)">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="655" y="890" width="490" height="195" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="decoder-23" label="&lt;b&gt;3  Feed-forward network&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;y = LayerNorm(x)&lt;br&gt;Linear 256 → 1024 → GELU&lt;br&gt;Linear 1024 → 256&lt;br&gt;x ← x + FFN(y)" tooltip="3  Feed-forward network&#10;y = LayerNorm(x)&#10;Linear 256 → 1024 → GELU&#10;Linear 1024 → 256&#10;x ← x + FFN(y)">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1262" y="890" width="490" height="195" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <mxCell id="decoder-24" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="decoder-21" target="decoder-22">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="decoder-25" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="decoder-22" target="decoder-23">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
        </mxCell>
        <object id="decoder-26" label="&lt;b&gt;TRAINING  /  One sampled flow time per example&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;y = normalized ground-truth action chunk&lt;br&gt;ε ∼ Normal(0, I);   u ∼ Uniform(0, 1)&lt;br&gt;xᵤ = (1 − u) ε + u y;   target velocity = y − ε&lt;br&gt;One decoder evaluation predicts vθ(xᵤ, u | context).&lt;br&gt;MSE over valid action dimensions within each example;&lt;br&gt;then average examples equally. Padding has zero loss.&lt;br&gt;Future actions are supervision; future observations are excluded." tooltip="TRAINING  /  One sampled flow time per example&#10;y = normalized ground-truth action chunk&#10;ε ∼ Normal(0, I);   u ∼ Uniform(0, 1)&#10;xᵤ = (1 − u) ε + u y;   target velocity = y − ε&#10;One decoder evaluation predicts vθ(xᵤ, u | context).&#10;MSE over valid action dimensions within each example;&#10;then average examples equally. Padding has zero loss.&#10;Future actions are supervision; future observations are excluded.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="notes">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1160" width="810" height="325" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="decoder-27" label="&lt;b&gt;INFERENCE  /  Receding-horizon control&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Start with a Gaussian action chunk at flow time u = 0.&lt;br&gt;Apply 8 Euler steps with the same decoder weights.&lt;br&gt;Δu = 1/8;   x ← x + Δu · vθ(x, u | context)&lt;br&gt;Denormalize the resulting 16 × 8 action chunk.&lt;br&gt;Execute the first 4 commands, then observe and replan.&lt;br&gt;The observation context is shared across the flow evaluations.&lt;br&gt;Training does not run this whole Euler loop for each example." tooltip="INFERENCE  /  Receding-horizon control&#10;Start with a Gaussian action chunk at flow time u = 0.&#10;Apply 8 Euler steps with the same decoder weights.&#10;Δu = 1/8;   x ← x + Δu · vθ(x, u | context)&#10;Denormalize the resulting 16 × 8 action chunk.&#10;Execute the first 4 commands, then observe and replan.&#10;The observation context is shared across the flow evaluations.&#10;Training does not run this whole Euler loop for each example.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="notes">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="920" y="1160" width="832" height="325" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
