        <object id="context-12" label="&lt;b&gt;Current auxiliary tokens · three separate branches&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;State: 15 observed + 8 preceding action + 1 availability = 24&lt;br&gt;Linear 24 → 256 → SiLU → Linear 256 → 256  ⇒  1 token&lt;br&gt;Goal: pooled text encoder output  ⇒  1 token&lt;br&gt;Clock: [conditioning, execution] / 100 → Linear 2 → 256  ⇒  1 token&lt;br&gt;These three tokens bypass the metadata adapter.&lt;br&gt;Concatenate with ≤64 adapted current visual tokens." tooltip="Current auxiliary tokens · three separate branches&#10;State: 15 observed + 8 preceding action + 1 availability = 24&#10;Linear 24 → 256 → SiLU → Linear 256 → 256  ⇒  1 token&#10;Goal: pooled text encoder output  ⇒  1 token&#10;Clock: [conditioning, execution] / 100 → Linear 2 → 256  ⇒  1 token&#10;These three tokens bypass the metadata adapter.&#10;Concatenate with ≤64 adapted current visual tokens.">
