        <object id="context-35" label="&lt;b&gt;Decision batching and compute&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Global effective batch: 64 decisions/update&lt;br&gt;Microbatch cap: 16 decisions/device/pass&lt;br&gt;4-GPU example: 16 decisions/rank/update&lt;br&gt;Historical encoder block batch: 32&lt;br&gt;CPU loader workers: 8/rank; prefetch factor: 1&lt;br&gt;Activation checkpointing: false&lt;br&gt;50,000 optimizer updates · AdamW · learning rate 0.0001&lt;br&gt;Auto precision prefers BF16; geometry/reductions remain FP32.&lt;br&gt;Loader workers prefetch raw packed observations, not learned features." tooltip="Decision batching and compute&#10;Global effective batch: 64 decisions/update&#10;Microbatch cap: 16 decisions/device/pass&#10;4-GPU example: 16 decisions/rank/update&#10;Historical encoder block batch: 32&#10;CPU loader workers: 8/rank; prefetch factor: 1&#10;Activation checkpointing: false&#10;50,000 optimizer updates · AdamW · learning rate 0.0001&#10;Auto precision prefers BF16; geometry/reductions remain FP32.&#10;Loader workers prefetch raw packed observations, not learned features.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="notes">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="970" y="1040" width="782" height="410" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="context-36" label="&lt;b&gt;Weights are small; history activations can be large&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;FP32 parameter storage: 24.39 MB&lt;br&gt;Weights + gradients + two FP32 Adam moments: ~97.58 MB&lt;br&gt;These figures exclude activations, attention workspace and CUDA.&lt;br&gt;Autocast does not change the stored FP32 parameter count.&lt;br&gt;Each DDP rank holds a replica; GPU memory is not pooled." tooltip="Weights are small; history activations can be large&#10;FP32 parameter storage: 24.39 MB&#10;Weights + gradients + two FP32 Adam moments: ~97.58 MB&#10;These figures exclude activations, attention workspace and CUDA.&#10;Autocast does not change the stored FP32 parameter count.&#10;Each DDP rank holds a replica; GPU memory is not pooled.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="notes">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1510" width="825" height="225" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="context-37" label="&lt;b&gt;Scope and source of truth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This diagram describes the joint-encoder, flow-decoder teacher.&lt;br&gt;Prepared data supplies calibrated XYZRGB and causal state.&lt;br&gt;Compact TREE/FLAT/router/Perceiver are subsequent stages.&lt;br&gt;Action normalizer: no trainable weights; fitted statistics are buffers.&lt;br&gt;Code + config are authoritative. Regenerate after architecture edits." tooltip="Scope and source of truth&#10;This diagram describes the joint-encoder, flow-decoder teacher.&#10;Prepared data supplies calibrated XYZRGB and causal state.&#10;Compact TREE/FLAT/router/Perceiver are subsequent stages.&#10;Action normalizer: no trainable weights; fitted statistics are buffers.&#10;Code + config are authoritative. Regenerate after architecture edits.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="notes">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="970" y="1510" width="782" height="225" />
